# Residential proxy URL examples (reference only; parser reads PARSER_PROXY_LIST).
#
# Usage:
#   cat config/env/.env.residential.example >> .env
#   # uncomment and fill one PARSER_PROXY_LIST block below
#   make proxy-check
#
# Requires: real provider credentials. Placeholder URLs hard-fail crawl immediately.
#
# Parser reads only PARSER_PROXY_LIST (comma-separated HTTP proxy URLs).
# Provider-specific env below are for your reference when building the URL.

# --- DataImpulse (example) ---
# RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_HOST=gw.dataimpulse.com
# RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_PORT=823
# RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_USER=your-login
# RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_PASS=your-password
# PARSER_PROXY_LIST=http://${RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_USER}:${RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_PASS}@${RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_HOST}:${RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_PORT}

# --- IPRoyal (example) ---
# RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_HOST=geo.iproyal.com
# RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_PORT=12321
# RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_USER=your-login
# RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_PASS=your-password
# PARSER_PROXY_LIST=http://${RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_USER}:${RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_PASS}@${RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_HOST}:${RESIDENTIAL_PROXY_PORT}

# --- HProxy / similar low-cost (example) ---
# PARSER_PROXY_LIST=http://user:pass@proxy.hproxy.com:port

# Comma-separate endpoints for round-robin; httpclient applies 10m CF cooldown per URL.
# PARSER_PROXY_LIST=http://user:pass@host1:port,http://user:pass@host2:port
